\end_inset
 מתקיים:
\begin_inset Formula
\[
f\left(\frac{\ln x}{\ln a}\right)=a^{\frac{\ln x}{\ln a}}=\exp\left(\frac{\ln x}{\ln a}\cdot\ln\left(a\right)\right)=\exp\left(\ln\left(x\right)\right)=x
\]


\end_inset
ומכאן שגם:
\begin_inset Formula
\[
